            ],
            "Add a section": [
                "\u0414\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0456\u043b"
            ],
            "Describe the section": [
                "\u041e\u043f\u0438\u0448\u0456\u0442\u044c \u0440\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0456\u043b"
            ],
            "For example: \"pricing with three plans for a dog-walking service\". It is built from the section library in your brand style.": [
